WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.520
Once upon a time, there was a little mouse who lived in anguish, terrified of the cat.

00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:13.640
One day, a wizard, dying of pity for the poor little mouse, took pity on him and transformed him into a cat.

00:00:13.640 --> 00:00:19.700
The cat's tranquility was short-lived as he was soon terrified of the dog.

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:24.140
The wizard once again took pity and transformed the cat into a dog.

00:00:24.140 --> 00:00:27.300
The dog left, all happy.

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:33.940
De qualquer forma, o seu joio foi short-lived, o que era pronto tremendo com a feira do jaguar.

00:00:33.940 --> 00:00:40.800
O wizard once again took pity e transformou ele em um jaguar.

00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:50.860
O jaguar, agora confundente e coragemoso, entrou na floresta, mas foi pronto terrível do hunter.

00:00:50.860 --> 00:01:00.680
